Build-Info-Perl version 0.1.1
=============================

Some Perl tooling to collection build information.

There are several end goals:

- to eventually be semi-compatible with Artifactory build info
- generate a Perl module for a given project so the build
  information can be used programmatically
- generate POD for the Perl module to ease use of the build information

SEE ALSO

- https://github.com/jfrog/build-info

